Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.21,0:00:04.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.29,0:00:06.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我回来啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.25,0:00:08.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生 莉露酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.63,0:00:09.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.01,0:00:11.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们买了特产回来！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.63,0:00:15.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢啦 是什么呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:24.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:28.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是步行金鯱啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.98,0:00:30.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得是亚纳戈的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.90,0:00:33.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,咦 你懂得真多啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.74,0:00:34.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哪里哪里\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.86,0:00:37.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只是装作学者罢了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.37,0:00:39.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙是莉露打倒的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.83,0:00:41.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那可真厉害\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:45.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,两位是身手了得的冒险者呢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.37,0:00:49.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那当然啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:54.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此 那样的话…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.17,0:00:56.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个… 其实我\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.97,0:00:59.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,正在收集怪物的数据\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.55,0:01:01.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果可以的话\n能不能请你们和我一起进地下城\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:04.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,担任一下我的护卫呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.96,0:01:32.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29岁单身中坚冒险者的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.07,0:02:44.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（第7话 莉露和可可）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.45,0:02:46.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天还请大家多关照了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.83,0:02:48.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,请多关照\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子也要一起去吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.29,0:02:52.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.38,0:02:54.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我明明叫她待着别来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.47,0:02:59.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.55,0:03:01.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,小孩子进地下城很危险哦？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.80,0:03:03.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己不也是小孩子！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:06.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,本来冒险者就很多不靠谱的家伙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:08.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是工作敷衍了事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.56,0:03:09.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸也不好强硬地说什么啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.98,0:03:11.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也要一起去啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.56,0:03:13.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可可 你太没礼貌了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:16.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始可是会好好工作的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.57,0:03:18.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哼！谁知道呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.20,0:03:29.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,明明阿始那么厉害…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.21,0:03:32.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是个讨厌的女孩子！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.71,0:03:35.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,最好踩到陷阱吃点苦头才好呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.34,0:03:39.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（陷阱）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.89,0:03:54.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那边有陷阱 很危险的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.23,0:03:59.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.53,0:04:02.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这个是“陷阱感知眼镜”\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.20,0:04:05.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,浅层的陷阱都能看穿\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:10.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,用不着你多管闲事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:14.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过嘛 我就稍微提高一下\n对你的信赖程度吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.38,0:04:27.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,和原始数据相比没有变化…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:31.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这种到处都有的怪物也要记录吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.98,0:04:34.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,说到这个地下城\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:37.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,问公会的姐姐不就知道了吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:40.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么还要重新调查呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.48,0:04:42.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 好问题\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.15,0:04:44.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 好问题\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.95,0:04:47.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,至今仍然充满谜团\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.03,0:04:51.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候某天出现的怪物会突然改变\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:52.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就算是同一种怪物\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:54.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大小也会不同\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:57.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,经常出现让冒险者头疼的变化\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:05:02.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过 也有能够\n提前看出变化征兆的例子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.63,0:05:04.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有见过\n史莱姆在房间角落抖啊抖\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.01,0:05:07.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,然后不动了的情况？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.68,0:05:12.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,没有呀\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:14.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你发现了 可别打倒它\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:16.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,第二天再去看看试试？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.23,0:05:20.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,应该会变成\n眼睛像宝石一样的史莱姆哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.86,0:05:22.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么！宝石史莱姆？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.19,0:05:24.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.86,0:05:28.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,当然是真的 为了察觉这种征兆\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.49,0:05:31.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,定期观察是很有必要的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:36.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊 你连这种事都不知道？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:39.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这可是很有名的案例耶？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.25,0:05:43.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以说冒险者就是笨啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:45.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,类似的情况还有好几种呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.59,0:05:52.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 一不小心说漏嘴了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.01,0:05:54.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,少胡说八道！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:56.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,“说漏嘴”不是这个意思啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.35,0:05:58.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀哎呀\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.31,0:06:01.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在地下城里请不要大声喧哗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.77,0:06:05.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,别在地下城吵架 你们这些笨蛋！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.56,0:06:43.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要稍微休息一下？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.86,0:06:44.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.95,0:06:51.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在画画吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:54.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是画得难看我可要嘲笑她的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.37,0:06:59.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.75,0:07:00.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,没 没什么啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.79,0:07:03.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你做这份工作已经很久了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.54,0:07:07.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不 平时我会帮忙务农\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:12.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,攒下一点积蓄后\n就像这样做学者的工作…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:14.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这些数据能卖出去\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:17.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就能让家人过上轻松点的生活了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.48,0:07:21.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但我一直给妻子和女儿添麻烦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.31,0:07:24.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,能让我看看吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:26.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了 请看\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.52,0:07:29.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我正希望能帮到冒险者们呢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.45,0:07:39.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这可真厉害\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.66,0:07:41.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有这么多信息\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:42.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,对冒险者来说太有帮助了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:46.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真想哪天也能看看这些数据\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:50.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 感觉在公会也能派上用场\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.13,0:07:54.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个… 对了 东云先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:07:57.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你之前不是去其他地方了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.35,0:07:59.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,去亚纳戈\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.11,0:08:07.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,委托书堆了不少啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:08.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟去了五天啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.57,0:08:12.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还收到了这么棒的土特产\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.70,0:08:14.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是过意不去…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.78,0:08:17.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.95,0:08:20.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就像平常一样随便做做吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.45,0:08:23.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就拜托你了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.79,0:08:24.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好嘞\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:30.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个 爸爸在工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.55,0:08:33.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我想把饭给他送到房间去\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.13,0:08:36.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可以呀 稍微等一下哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:39.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过好厉害呢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.31,0:08:42.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸是学者对吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.89,0:08:43.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好帅气啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.56,0:08:47.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不 没有啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.56,0:08:48.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.40,0:08:49.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,学者？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.48,0:08:53.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你是鸡兽人吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:56.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那你爸不也是个笨蛋吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:58.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟智力也只有鸡的水平嘛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.20,0:09:01.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋还自称学者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.79,0:09:03.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.17,0:09:14.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:16.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,明明一点都不了解爸爸\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:20.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸才不是笨蛋！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:25.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,笨的是你们这些冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.27,0:09:30.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是气死人的一天！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.90,0:09:33.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个鸡脑袋\n一个人都没法进地下城\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.15,0:09:35.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还一副了不起的样子！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.03,0:09:38.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是个让人火大的臭小鬼啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:40.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫可可的家伙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.20,0:09:43.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哼 你自己不也是小鬼\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.25,0:09:46.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还瞧不起莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:48.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,超级讨厌的家伙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:51.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然那个大叔又聪明又厉害\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:53.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但那小鬼可不行啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.67,0:09:55.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙仗着自己爸爸聪明\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.01,0:09:58.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就开始得意忘形了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:09:59.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,肚子饿了啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.55,0:10:02.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你有在听吗 阿始？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.56,0:10:03.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在听在听\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.97,0:10:06.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才绝对没在听\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:08.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露都气成这样了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:10.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你要好好听我说啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:11.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:18.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 今天你…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.74,0:10:19.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,东云先生！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:22.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我把数据拿去给公会的人看了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.70,0:10:25.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,结果 他们愿意收购！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.25,0:10:27.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且还说 只要保持同样的质量\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:29.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今后也可以持续收购\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:33.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的太感谢你们了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.42,0:10:35.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那可太好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.21,0:10:37.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来要忙起来喽！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.51,0:10:40.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:44.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们最近会暂时待在这个村子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.35,0:10:47.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以… 和你们好好相处\n也不是不行啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.23,0:10:51.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你那是什么表情啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:53.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你有话想说\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.15,0:10:54.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就直说啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.86,0:10:57.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你消失啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.61,0:10:58.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.40,0:11:02.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,说话给我注意点啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.99,0:11:08.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29岁单身中坚冒险者的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:12.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么把莉露留在家看门啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.88,0:11:15.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你给我重新考虑一下啊阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.67,0:11:18.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天真的很忙啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:21.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-喂 莉露 大叔村里的工作\n-跟那有什么关系\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.55,0:11:23.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-还剩很多没有处理完啦…\n-为什么要说这种话啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.05,0:11:26.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是因为忙\n所以才更需要咱们不是吗！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.85,0:11:30.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你真厉害啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.39,0:11:33.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露绝对能派上用场的 阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:35.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,带我去啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.40,0:11:38.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有史莱姆在天上飞哦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.36,0:11:41.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.91,0:11:42.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个混蛋！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.95,0:11:44.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,连莉露都没飞过呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:47.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在哪里啊阿始？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:52.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啥\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:55.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,居然真的把莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:58.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,丢下不管了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.13,0:12:01.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天也没办法吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:02.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.01,0:12:04.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等等我啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.51,0:12:05.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点 莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.68,0:12:10.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,放开我啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:12.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-都说了冷静点！\n-别拦着我 阿尼扬酱！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.56,0:12:16.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那边那几位铜级冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.15,0:12:19.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天能不能来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:21.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,协助一下我的工作呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.95,0:12:25.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来工作？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.24,0:12:26.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:31.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真有眼光！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:38.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,讨伐巨龙？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.71,0:12:41.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,上面写的是采矿啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.01,0:12:45.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原来你识字啊！阿尼扬戈酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.06,0:12:51.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那委托单的张贴\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.43,0:12:53.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就拜托阿尼扬戈酱了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.89,0:12:54.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那莉露呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.60,0:12:56.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露要做什么？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.52,0:12:58.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你打扫一下地板\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.12,0:13:08.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,交给我吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.66,0:13:11.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我会把地板擦得闪闪发亮的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:16.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿尼扬戈酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:19.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦贴一下讨伐山狼的委托单\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.88,0:13:20.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.63,0:13:22.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:38.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把这一列和这一列的数字加起来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.11,0:13:40.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,按顺序写上去就好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.98,0:13:41.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.13,0:14:10.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个… 是交到入口那边来着吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.06,0:14:15.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露也…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.57,0:14:24.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 你没事吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.99,0:14:33.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:35.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:38.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露什么忙都帮不上\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:40.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.92,0:14:42.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是很努力在打扫了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.71,0:14:45.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那种事谁都能做吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.21,0:14:47.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,才不是那样…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.38,0:14:51.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露不识字\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:55.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,力气又小 当冒险者根本不合格啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.39,0:14:58.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我这个同伴这么没用\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:00.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.44,0:15:06.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,别说这种话啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.16,0:15:14.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.91,0:15:20.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:22.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天的莉露酱确实\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.50,0:15:24.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只做了谁都能做的工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.46,0:15:29.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但是啊 看到那样的莉露酱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:32.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我心里还想着\n不愧是东云先生的同伴呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.39,0:15:34.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很佩服你哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.06,0:15:37.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,像这种驻村的工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.81,0:15:39.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,经常需要处理那些\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.39,0:15:42.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快到期限 却没人接的委托\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.61,0:15:45.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那类委托通常都是\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:47.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,费力气报酬却不高\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:50.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦又无聊的工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:54.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 要是因为工作很无聊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:56.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就随便应付了事的话\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.37,0:15:58.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是会关系到村子的存亡的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.33,0:16:01.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,对工作保持认真和诚实\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.25,0:16:05.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这才是驻村冒险者最重要的素质\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.63,0:16:07.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而这一点\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:10.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,正是东云先生和莉露酱所拥有的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:12.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,作为冒险者非常强大的“武器”哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.78,0:16:30.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,终于忙完啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.94,0:16:32.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.08,0:16:44.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我拜托她们两位帮忙做公会的工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.38,0:16:48.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露酱非常努力地帮我打扫了卫生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:50.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.01,0:16:52.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,东云先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.51,0:16:54.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我有件在意的事…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:11.74,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,读写能力啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:26.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天正好休息\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:27.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,时机刚好吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.63,0:17:35.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是莉露吗！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.93,0:17:37.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿尼扬酱！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.89,0:17:39.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露你也来上学了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:40.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,上学？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.01,0:17:43.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是来学习的吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:46.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,能和莉露一起我超开心的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.77,0:17:51.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好好玩啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.11,0:17:53.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,来 我们走吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.46,0:18:07.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这是莉露酱和可可酱噢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:09.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大家要好好相处\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.63,0:18:10.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.00,0:18:15.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这家伙也在这啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:18.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 莉露酱想学点什么呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.49,0:18:37.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露不擅长认字啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.15,0:18:39.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 是这样啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.07,0:18:41.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就学读写吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.41,0:18:44.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可可酱会读写对吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.33,0:18:46.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可以帮忙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.66,0:18:48.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,教教莉露酱吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.21,0:18:53.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,行吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:56.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我倒是可以教你啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:18:57.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但你可要心怀感激哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.01,0:18:59.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我会教到\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.13,0:19:00.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,连你这个笨蛋也能听懂为止\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:09.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你学得挺认真的嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:12.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,当冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.65,0:19:15.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,只要在地下城打倒怪物不就行了吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:16.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那样不行啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.57,0:19:20.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露想要能看懂委托书\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.49,0:19:23.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还能查怪物资料\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:25.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:27.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,想变成像阿始那样的人啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:34.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:37.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那也挺好的吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:41.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也梦想成为像爸爸那样的学者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:48.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛 不行吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.89,0:19:51.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,梦想… 原来如此…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.06,0:19:57.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露的梦想是\n成为超级厉害的冒险者啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.16,0:20:08.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的！那样拿笔\n没法写出漂亮的字啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:10.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,得用手指夹住…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.58,0:20:13.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,对\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.38,0:20:22.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,学习得怎么样了 莉露？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.51,0:20:23.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿尼扬酱！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.01,0:20:27.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个… 这位是莉露的新朋友对吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.51,0:20:29.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我是阿尼扬戈 多多指教\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.68,0:20:33.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,才不是朋友好吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.86,0:20:43.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 来玩躲避球吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.45,0:20:45.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢！好呀好呀\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:50.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一起玩吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.71,0:20:52.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我就不去了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.29,0:20:55.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我还想再看会儿书\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.38,0:20:57.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:20:59.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:00.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.63,0:21:03.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好嘞 久等啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.05,0:21:04.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快点快点\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.22,0:21:07.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天的莉露可有点不一样哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.40,0:21:17.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这是 长戟大兜蜻蜓！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.98,0:21:19.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 好厉害 太帅了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.15,0:21:22.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在我的城镇可见不到这种品种！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.78,0:21:24.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也带上我一起玩吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.78,0:21:26.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 来吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.91,0:21:28.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不继续看书了吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.58,0:21:31.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,咦？那是可可…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:35.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在和朋友一起玩呢！真难得啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.33,0:21:38.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看招！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.13,0:21:42.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,扔给莉露！扔给莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.26,0:21:46.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他们关系不错嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.01,0:21:49.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,做得不错嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.26,0:21:52.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,自然环境又漂亮 生物也很丰富\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.56,0:21:56.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可可看起来也精神多了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:22:01.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这里真是个好村子啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.04,0:23:40.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（下一话 村子的一员）\n
